   "lines": [
    "Made late start.",
    "Left wagon on",
    "prairie & Merrif[ield]",
    "& I rode on",
    "and spent",
    "night at",
    "Langs. Out on",
    "prairie got",
    "caught in",
    "driving hail",
    "storm; sheltered",
    "in a washout.",
    "Wind so strong",
    "could hardly",
    "stand; ponies would",
    "not face it. Our",
    "\"slickers\" and chaps",
    "kept us perfectly dry,",
    "in spite of the driving",
    "rain. The Winchester",
    "45-75 shoots beautifully."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "medium",
   "note": "1884 entry. Name at right edge cut off by binding/film. Very heavy show-through in lower half."
